source_1 = "record 22.30.116 [doc.02] (misleading): Read the page and checked its network, endpoint and lifecycle claims. The quickstart publishes api-mainnet-beta.paxeer.network/rpc and /rpc/ws as public hosted endpoints, describes custody credit submitted to that router, and retains separate sequencer trust and settlement-era steps. Rewrite proposal: Rewrite docs/site/docs/overview/quickstart.md with root-path mainnet-beta RPC, chain id 125, committed-block finality and the supported hosted intent flow; isolate any retained private-network instructions from public-network setup."
